      "description": "A flat, pale container for automated-check context.",
      "html": "<aside class=\"ds-card\"><h2>Automated checks</h2><p>No checks have run yet. Create your tool to generate test results.</p></aside>",
      "css": ".ds-card{padding:23px;border-radius:8px;background:#f7f9fc;color:var(--ink,#202d3e);font-family:\"DM Sans\",sans-serif;max-width:300px}.ds-card h2{font-size:18px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0 0 12px}.ds-card p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--muted,#5b6779);margin:0}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Selected challenge row",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "challenge-row-selected",
      "description": "The desktop selection combines pale fill, a one-pixel indicator, and a labeled button state.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-row\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-id\">12</span><span class=\"ds-row-copy\"><span class=\"ds-meta\">Documents &amp; messages</span><strong>Turn messages into a daily timeline</strong><span class=\"ds-summary\">Keep tasks and source references in one daily timeline.</span></span><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-row{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:19px 17px;width:100%;min-height:113px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #e7ecf3;background:#fff;color:var(--ink,#202d3e);text-align:left;cursor:pointer;font-family:\"DM Sans\",sans-serif}.ds-row:hover{background:#f7f9fd}.ds-row[aria-pressed=true]{background:#edf3fe}.ds-row[aria-pressed=true]::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:1px;background:var(--blue,#275ac3)}.ds-row:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--blue,#275ac3);outline-offset:3px}.ds-row>svg{color:var(--blue,#275ac3);flex-shrink:0}.ds-id{align-self:flex-start;margin-top:3px;width:23px;flex-shrink:0;color:#66758a;font:400 11px/1.5 \"IBM Plex Mono\",monospace}.ds-row-copy{display:block;flex:1;min-width:0}.ds-meta{display:block;font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:#60718a;margin-bottom:7px}.ds-row-copy strong{display:block;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-summary{display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:1;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted,#5b6779)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Workspace tabs",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "workspace-tab-selected",
      "description": "Underlined task views; application code supplies arrow-key and Home/End navigation.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Tool views\"><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\">Your request</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">Try your tool</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">Review &amp; download</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-tabs{display:flex;gap:25px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#dfe5ed);overflow:auto}.ds-tabs button{background:none;border:0;padding:12px 2px 15px;font:400 12px \"DM Sans\",sans-serif;color:var(--muted,#5b6779);white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer}.ds-tabs button:hover{color:var(--blue,#275ac3)}.ds-tabs button[aria-selected=true]{color:var(--blue,#275ac3);box-shadow:inset 0 -2px var(--blue,#275ac3);font-weight:600}.ds-tabs button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--blue,#275ac3);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Labeled states",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "status",
      "description": "A state always combines an icon and readable words with semantic color.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-states\"><span class=\"ds-status ds-complete\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12 4 4L19 6\"/></svg>Approved</span><span class=\"ds-status ds-review\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 4 6v6c0 5 8 9 8 9s8-4 8-9V6l-8-3Z\"/></svg>Ready to try</span><span class=\"ds-status ds-failed\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M12 7v6m0 3v1\"/></svg>Needs help</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-states{display:flex;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}.ds-status{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;white-space:nowrap;font:500 11px/1.5 \"DM Sans\",sans-serif;color:#5a697d}.ds-status svg{width:13px;height:13px}.ds-complete{color:#28734e}.ds-review{color:#93601e}.ds-failed{color:#ab4534}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Next action banner",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "next-action",
      "description": "The current task and action are grouped; review and approved variants use functional tints.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-next ds-review\"><div><h2>Your tool is ready to try.</h2><p>Try it with sample data. Check that it solves your problem, then review it.</p></div><button class=\"ds-button ds-primary\">Try your tool</button></section>",
      "css": ".ds-button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:37px;padding:8px 13px;border:1px solid #ced7e4;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;color:#34445b;font:500 12px/1.5 \"DM Sans\",sans-serif;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .16s ease-out,color .16s ease-out}.ds-button:hover{background:#f0f4fa;border-color:#aebed3}.ds-button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--blue,#275ac3);outline-offset:3px}.ds-button:disabled{cursor:not-allowed;opacity:.48}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button{transition:none}}.ds-primary{background:var(--blue,#275ac3);border-color:var(--blue,#275ac3);color:#fff}.ds-primary:hover{background:#19489f;border-color:#19489f}.ds-next{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:25px;padding:21px 24px;background:#f0f5ff;border:1px solid #dce6fa;border-radius:8px;font-family:\"DM Sans\",sans-serif}.ds-next h2{font-size:17px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#294b82;margin:0 0 6px}.ds-next p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#4a638c;margin:0;max-width:68ch}.ds-next>.ds-button{flex-shrink:0}.ds-next.ds-review{background:#fbf7ed;border-color:#ebe1c7}.ds-next.ds-review h2{color:#795b22}.ds-next.ds-review p{color:#75623e}.ds-next.ds-approved{background:#f0f8f3;border-color:#d9e8df}.ds-next.ds-approved h2{color:#2a654a}.ds-next.ds-approved p{color:#486a57}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-next{display:block;padding:19px}.ds-next>.ds-button{margin-top:17px}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Field Workspace",
    "overview": "The Field Workspace gives frontline personnel a calm place to describe a problem and judge a resulting tool. Cool white work surfaces sit beside a pale slate rail; ink text, restrained cobalt actions, divided rows, and aligned columns make a dense interface readable. The tone is practical and direct.\n\nThis record describes the implemented V3 world only. Plain-language requests, progress, trying the tool, and review lead the interface. Technical output remains available through disclosure. It does not change the original Desktop or Studio identities.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Cool white surfaces and a pale slate navigation rail.",
      "Compact divided lists with adjacent detail on desktop.",
      "DM Sans for the interface; IBM Plex Mono for identifiers and technical output.",
      "Restrained cobalt for actions, selection, and keyboard focus.",
      "Visible text and icons accompany status color."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Action Accent Rule",
        "body": "Use cobalt to identify an action, selection, or focus state. Keep broad work surfaces white or pale slate.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Labeled State Rule",
        "body": "Pair state color with readable words and a recognizable icon; a colored dot alone does not carry the state.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Plain Task Rule",
        "body": "Use sentence-case task language in the main workflow. Reserve monospace for identifiers, file paths, code, and execution output.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Workspace Rule",
        "body": "Use borders and tonal changes for working surfaces. Reserve the diffuse floating shadow for transient notifications.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do preserve visible focus, accessible control names, and text alongside status icons.",
      "Do keep task copy readable using the final type overrides: row titles are 14px; row summaries and desktop row metadata are 12px.",
      "Do use the adjacent detail pattern on desktop and an explicit drill-in with a return control on mobile.",
      "Do keep request, creation, trial, and review actions prominent while technical information remains secondary.",
      "Do use inline SVG icons and the existing geometric brand mark; the V3 interface ships no raster imagery.",
      "Do preserve the original Desktop and Studio interfaces and their separate design records."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don’t make status depend on color alone or remove accessible names when compact navigation hides visible labels.",
      "Don’t replace the working list with decorative cards, a promotional hero, or ornamental imagery.",
      "Don’t use monospace for primary task titles or ordinary instructions.",
      "Don’t apply the toast shadow to ordinary panels or turn the one-pixel selection indicator into a decorative accent stripe.",
      "Don’t treat small footer, identifier, or tag typography as the default for instructions or required task information.",
      "Don’t infer operational readiness from a green check or an approved prototype state."
    ]
  }
}
